{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, how's it going? Been a while since we talked. Hope all is good."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-66b09017a93b6ff21847a811", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.393023+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "66b09017a93b6ff21847a811", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "66b09017a93b6ff21847a811", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan! It's been a rough week - I gave in and bought some unhealthy snacks. I feel kinda guilty. How's it going for you? That painting is awesome! Did you paint it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-70dcec3ae8da4d15ab1cd3e6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.416034+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "70dcec3ae8da4d15ab1cd3e6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "70dcec3ae8da4d15ab1cd3e6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, sorry to hear about the rough week. Don't worry about the snacks. I'm doing okay, just finished this painting of a sunset. It really helps me relax. So, how's everything going with you? Anything new and exciting?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-fea42d5534c1b0bfb07147a1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.442260+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fea42d5534c1b0bfb07147a1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fea42d5534c1b0bfb07147a1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! Yeah, I just couldn't resist them. Gotta do better. As for me, just dealing with work stress and trying to stay motivated."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-376a2c95493dac416d350c59", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.469796+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "376a2c95493dac416d350c59", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "376a2c95493dac416d350c59", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, work stress can really get to you. Have you tried anything new to de-stress? Maybe picking up a hobby or something could help."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-4ea395c3d610025cd6ad91ef", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.492235+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4ea395c3d610025cd6ad91ef", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4ea395c3d610025cd6ad91ef", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thinking about trying something different outdoors. Any suggestions?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-09c04cd59307bb3ed0f3a1df", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.510070+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "09c04cd59307bb3ed0f3a1df", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "09c04cd59307bb3ed0f3a1df", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Sounds good! Have you ever tried kayaking? It's a fun and active way to paddle on a river or lake. What are your thoughts on that?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-5a084557888cd2f0ca861880", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.524841+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5a084557888cd2f0ca861880", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5a084557888cd2f0ca861880", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Kayaking sounds awesome! Haven't tried it yet, but it looks like a fun way to get in some exercise and enjoy nature. I'm definitely considering giving it a try. Thanks!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-008f7418cb3d1df5ba1e4bbc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.544407+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "008f7418cb3d1df5ba1e4bbc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "008f7418cb3d1df5ba1e4bbc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: No worries, Sam! It's a fun way to get in some exercise and enjoy nature. Let me know when you're ready to give it a try and I can hook you up with a good spot."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-0e3fc05dbad7b00e3d0d8f6e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.562690+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0e3fc05dbad7b00e3d0d8f6e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0e3fc05dbad7b00e3d0d8f6e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks for the idea, my mate and I are just around the corner from kayaking on the lake, we're going to try that now!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-77c7e9e32aaa3b0367769f3d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.581724+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "77c7e9e32aaa3b0367769f3d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "77c7e9e32aaa3b0367769f3d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Of course, let me know if you like it, we can plan a kayaking trip together, I'll pick a cool spot!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-13bb727933970739fc7c3a2e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.598556+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "13bb727933970739fc7c3a2e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "13bb727933970739fc7c3a2e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Yep, Evan! Can't wait. Thanks for the help!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-2555b7f44f35c45b55b4570f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.615264+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2555b7f44f35c45b55b4570f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2555b7f44f35c45b55b4570f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Ready for an adventure? Where will you go?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-ec8fc3911ce885f3d20730e7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.631809+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ec8fc3911ce885f3d20730e7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ec8fc3911ce885f3d20730e7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: We're traveling through Lake Tahoe! I heard it's great for kayaking."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-f1b26ab9e2637cc0d5660672", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.644323+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f1b26ab9e2637cc0d5660672", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f1b26ab9e2637cc0d5660672", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, it's an awesome pick! You'll love it there - clear water and gorgeous views. Have a blast and take lots of pics!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-5bb6a89bf11ceb275d7b3a8b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.664579+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5bb6a89bf11ceb275d7b3a8b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5bb6a89bf11ceb275d7b3a8b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! I'm looking forward to it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R2-locomo-conv-49/session_13-70828479da2cfa84928cee15", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T09:01:27.680186+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "70828479da2cfa84928cee15", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "70828479da2cfa84928cee15", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
